    <h1>BEEF BREAKFAST BOWL</h1>
    <p>Meal type: Breakfast</p>
    <p>Servings: 5</p>
    <p>Calories per serving: approximately 500</p>
    <p>Protein per serving: approximately 35 grams</p>
    <h2>Ingredients</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Ground beef — 2 lbs</li>
        <li>Eggs — 10</li>
        <li>Bell peppers — 3, diced</li>
        <li>Spinach — 5 cups</li>
        <li>Olive oil — 2 tbsp</li>
        <li>Salt and pepper — to taste</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Directions</h2>
    <ol>
        <li>Cook beef in olive oil until browned.</li>
        <li>Add peppers and spinach, cook until soft.</li>
        <li>Scramble eggs, combine with beef mixture.</li>
        <li>Season with salt and pepper.</li>
    </ol>
    <h2>Meal Prep</h2>
    <p>Cook and combine all ingredients. Store in refrigerator. Reheat in microwave.</p>
